  "description": "A high-performance .NET library for the Windows Recycle Bin: move files and directories into it, list what is in it, restore entries, empty it, and report the outcome of every item. It reads and writes the Recycle Bin's own files — no SHFileOperation, no IFileOperation, no COM.",
