  "releaseNotes": "1.2.0: Progress reporting on RecycleAsync, RestoreAsync and EmptyAsync — each settings type carries OnItemProcessed, OnProgressFailed and WaitForProgressCallbacks, and each handler is given a RecycleProgress, a RestoreProgress or an EmptyProgress. EmptyAsync gains an overload taking EmptyOptions\n            1.1.0: Support for the first version of the Recycle Bin index file, on machines whose Windows reads that one rather than the second\n            1.0.0: First release",
